#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "This will get you started on farming."
msgstr "Isso te ajudará a começar na agricultura."

#. Key:	0381BFA6430BE33F98A4DCB46112A677
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "To have access to best gear you first need to prove yourself. Hunt and gather all the feathers!"
msgstr "Para ter acesso ao melhor equipamento, primeiro é necessário provar-se. Caçar e coletar todas as penas!"

#. Key:	1570B7C94DB585DEED98CFB3D7437DB3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Lets see what you can do, craft the following items."
msgstr "Vamos ver o que você pode fazer, produza os seguintes itens."

#. Key:	16A9029B40C25C49A3FD63BAF679FFAB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Who said fishing is boring? It's exploring with a big reward in the end. Mysterious fish can be found everywhere."
msgstr "Quem disse que pescar é chato? É explorar com uma grande recompensa no final. Peixes misteriosos podem ser encontrados em todos os lugares."

#. Key:	178117BD4C48AF461430AAAA3356652A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Explore all the House upgrade paths to discover new possibilities."
msgstr "Explore todos os caminhos de atualização da Casa para descobrir novas possibilidades."

#. Key:	260D6CDA4A9EB8AD08F627B5828CE66F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Be ready for nights when there's no solar power!"
msgstr "Esteja preparado para noites sem energia solar!"

#. Key:	2944073B49A41E8A6D6CE4B335B554E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "To become a master fisher. You will need to find catch all the fishes there is."
msgstr "Para se tornar um mestre pescador, você precisará pegar todos os peixes que existem."

#. Key:	3223971F4720B4FD53627AB71562FA5E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Travel to warm Kolkka."
msgstr "Viaje para Kolkka quente."

#. Key:	3FFA5EC643468FD456468E86887FFB53
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Rumors of extraordinary animals have been going around for a while. It's time to find out if they are true."
msgstr "Rumores de animais extraordinários têm circulado por um tempo. É hora de descobrir se são verdadeiros."

#. Key:	49270AFD4D72ED029E5F9296F9668852
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Before you can head into the mines, you will need to prepare accordingly."
msgstr "Antes de poder entrar nas minas, você precisará se preparar adequadamente."

#. Key:	4E8CB8374C952366548557939B7DD928
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Cooking is much like art. Experiment with different ingredients and challenge yourself to cook every dish to perfection!"
msgstr "Cozinhar é muito parecido com arte. Experimente com diferentes ingredientes e desafie-se a cozinhar cada prato à perfeição!"

#. Key:	548AD88C47DDD857CAED4F9BD13D8A71
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Now that you have collected new ores, it's time to start making ingots!"
msgstr "Agora que você coletou novos minérios, é hora de começar a fabricar lingotes!"

#. Key:	58DF9606488AED1328F92DB36D229AB1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Travel to barren Krokon."
msgstr "Viaje para a árida Krokon."

#. Key:	5D70698E4A3E8730880FE18C7BF801AB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "There is a second, even bigger mine. Go and find out what lies within!"
msgstr "Há uma segunda mina, ainda maior. Vá descobrir o que há lá dentro!"

#. Key:	621552EB4E0D225287B5B3A190841960
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "All researches need a base of operation."
msgstr "Todas as pesquisas precisam de uma base de operações."

#. Key:	627CE9FC488C26B54C9EA3B8682525DC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Brighten up your yard with beautiful colors!"
msgstr "Encha seu jardim de belas cores!"

#. Key:	65C8E9214CDF4A393D44A0ADEFC70C0D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Go to the mines and access the facility's loot rooms. You might discover something valuable!"
msgstr "Vá até as minas e acesse os quartos de saque das instalações. Você pode descobrir algo valioso!"

#. Key:	7207383841F9E31FA71166B24D10BC51
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Travel to Norra and Grunni. Visit the arenas and try your luck with the loot! "
msgstr "Viaje para Norra e Grunni. Visite as arenas e tente a sua sorte com o saque!"

#. Key:	79BFED3547BB76648BB97CB22A9B1667
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Upgrade your tent to a house. "
msgstr "Atualize sua barraca para uma casa."

#. Key:	7A6E8E4D462D9447DA8277BDD7782CD0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Deal with the birds. You can keep the feathers."
msgstr "Lide com os pássaros. Você pode ficar com as penas."

#. Key:	835079A141AD412AD51AE38152EE73C8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Locally produced food is always best."
msgstr "Alimentos produzidos localmente são sempre os melhores."

#. Key:	841B99BD44AE34F4B33FE5BC56C75584
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Your house needs wood deposits to stay intact."
msgstr "Sua casa precisa de depósitos de madeira para se manter intacta."

#. Key:	9C6C29AE44D88E87C3F820858DA2D84C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "The fuel prices are outrageous these days! It's time to find the LRI oil rig and make some fuel by yourself."
msgstr "Os preços dos combustíveis estão escandalosos hoje em dia! É hora de encontrar a plataforma petrolífera LRI e fazer seu próprio combustível."

#. Key:	9CAB5E654975D5FBD46987A4C89767A4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Travel to beautiful Isla Inocentes."
msgstr "Viaje para a bela Isla Inocentes."

#. Key:	A661DF0842CB060312194C941D9F1983
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Sirola has the best selection of items that are needed for upgrading your house."
msgstr "Sirola tem a melhor seleção de itens necessários para atualizar sua casa."

#. Key:	AF2515DE449DB78F09C12AA870210753
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Although LRI can be jerks sometimes, they've actually set up some pretty cool stuff for us here on the island."
msgstr "Embora a LRI possa ser chata às vezes, eles realmente montaram algumas coisas legais para nós aqui na ilha."

#. Key:	AFE04D2D442B1FA65FB16F935186F28B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Farming is honest work but first requires you to explore the island and find plants to farm on your own."
msgstr "A agricultura é um trabalho honesto, mas primeiro você precisa explorar a ilha e encontrar plantas para cultivar por conta própria."

#. Key:	B2759ED144749D1315D4DDBCE13743BF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Travel to faraway Jumo."
msgstr "Viaje para o distante Jumo."

#. Key:	B498F6EA46EC7F66A94F97969719B312
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Mix it up for fun. "
msgstr "Misture para se divertir."

#. Key:	C579980F4F04DFDF945CCF8AFE1CDB29
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Others stealing your crops? The farming vendor is selling AutoDefenders to help you with that."
msgstr "Outros roubando suas colheitas? O vendedor de agricultura está vendendo AutoDefensores para ajudar você com isso."

#. Key:	D1117DF642D0D06098457C9215B9851C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Hats aren't just for fashion; they hold surprisingly useful effects as well. Let's see if you can collect these ones."
msgstr "As chapéus não são apenas para a moda; eles contêm efeitos surpreendentemente úteis também. Vamos ver se você pode coletar estes."

#. Key:	D26C2F4F41E4740FB3351FA79F0657D5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "A collar, you say? Perfect! Swap it at the vendor for your own speedy mount. Adventure awaits!"
msgstr "Uma coleira, dizes? Perfeito! Troca-a com o vendedor pela tua montada veloz. A aventura espera!"

#. Key:	D4535122400B36F42FA575B7256C441D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Travel to north of Nauvo."
msgstr "Viaje para o norte de Nauvoo."

#. Key:	D6F09ADD4B9270DAC4CFF8AF8ECADA7A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Welcome to Longvinter island! Start earning some Mk to buy your own tent. Following these tasks will help you get started!"
msgstr "Bem-vindo(a) à ilha de Longvinter! Comece a ganhar Mk para comprar sua própria tenda. Seguir essas tarefas ajudará você a começar!"

#. Key:	D799974942F9D4030FBC7F8C6ACE03D2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Customize your weapons to suit your style better."
msgstr "Personalize suas armas para melhor se adequar ao seu estilo."

#. Key:	D8712B784A30A3B6533A029EDAC6A133
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Do you have what it takes to get to the gold?"
msgstr "Você tem o que é preciso para chegar ao ouro?"

#. Key:	D910B9F748E9D80446E99C8D97B96B71
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "LRI has a vast reach everywhere. Swing by the supply depot and see what's in store for you."
msgstr "LRI tem um vasto alcance em todo lugar. Passe pelo depósito de suprimentos e veja o que está reservado para você."

#. Key:	DF0010D34D891C2DB09C1EA1117752B3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Discover the mine, gather minerals, and explore while keeping an eye out for other miners!"
msgstr "Descubra a mina, colete minerais e explore, sempre atento aos outros mineradores!"

#. Key:	EE918C66480FADEC4E6A0B90463EFA8B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Fond of mining? Collect more resources from beneath the ground to obtain a golden ingot!"
msgstr "Gosta de mineração? Colete mais recursos do subsolo para obter um lingote dourado!"

